graph TD
    Front[前端应用 Console] --> Gateway[API 网关 Gateway]
    Gateway --> Back[后端 Spring Boot :9001]
    
    Back -. Dubbo RPC .-> RecSvc[推荐服务 recommend-provider :9004]
    
    subgraph RecEngine[RecommendEngine 核心引擎]
        Recall[多路召回 Recall] --> Rank[规则排序 Rank]
        Rank --> ReRank[重排序 ReRank]
    end
    
    RecSvc --> RecEngine
    
    RecEngine --> Redis[(Redis 缓存)]
    RecEngine --> MySQL[(MySQL 数据库)]
    RecEngine --> Spark[Spark 离线计算]